    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66177" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελο-θεσία</span></b> , ἡ,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλος</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>assignment of parts of the body to the tutelage
				of signs</i> or <i>planets</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antioch.Astr.
			</span></i> in <i>Cat. Cod.Astr.</i><i><span class="en">
				8(3).106.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>in Ptol.</u>
				201
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the
			Universe, <i>position of</i> its <i>parts</i> at the beginning
			of things, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Al.
				<u>T.</u>
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυή</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.147
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				214
			</span></i>.</div>
